WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.635
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.337
We hope you're all doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.272
And now we are gonna get
to the news.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.341
Supreme Court Justice
Stephen Breyer

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.276
is reportedly planning to retire

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.711
at the end of the current term,

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:14.480
which would allow President
Biden to appoint a successor.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.517
Said Mitch McConnell,
"With only three years

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:18.384
left in his term?

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.253
I don't think so."

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.757
President Biden visited
an ice cream store yesterday

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.926
in Washington, D.C.,
and reportedly

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.929
got a scoop of chocolate
with peanut butter flecks

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.698
and a scoop of
blackout chocolate cake.

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:36.035
So, yeah, he has seen
the approval numbers.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:38.204
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.573
"Oh, I'm going to need
a second scoop."

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:44.710
President Biden met today
with the CEOs of Ford,

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.979
General Motors, and several
other companies

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:49.048
to discuss
his Build Back Better agenda.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.917
But of course it
quickly devolved

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.685
into Biden pitching car names.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.521
"What about the Ford Shark?

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:57.924
That's a pretty good name.
The Ford Shark."

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.461
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.329
President Biden
told reporters yesterday

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.198
that a potential
Russian invasion of Ukraine

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.300
would likely be the "largest
invasion since World War II."

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:11.271
So, I guess he's never been
to a Target on Black Friday.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.239
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.808
In a video posted on social
media today,

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:18.011
former President Trump told
a golfing partner

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:21.247
that he would be
the 45th and 47th

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.748
President of the United States.

00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:24.350
Then again, it wouldn't be
the first time

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.553
he lied to a golf partner.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.556
"Put me down for a 4.

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:31.958
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.568
Yeah, it's a 4.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:43.770
It's a 4."

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.705
[ Applause ]

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:49.309
After Vermont Senator
Bernie Sanders suggested

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:51.511
that he would support
a primary challenger

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:53.513
against Democratic Senator
Joe Manchin,

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:57.183
Manchin said yesterday, "Senator
Sanders is not a Democrat.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.152
Said Sanders, "Thank you."

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.653
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.653 --> 00:02:04.924
Organizers of next month's
Winter Olympics in Beijing

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:08.127
announced they will provide
free condoms to athletes.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:11.664
And I'm pretty excited
to find out what that event is.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.899
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.899 --> 00:02:16.035
Seems weird it's in the winter.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:17.570
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.139
Amazon endorsed a bill
in Congress yesterday

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.542
that would legalize marijuana
on a federal level.

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.611
Oh, really?
Does Amazon support something

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:27.914
that would make it even harder
for people to go out to a store?

00:02:29.014 --> 00:02:32.251
"Alexa, order Doritos.

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.320
Yes, make weekly."

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.790
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:41.561
And finally, musician Kid Rock
released a song this week

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.496
that criticizes
coronavirus restrictions.

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.030
Oh, buddy, that's not why people

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.166
are staying six feet
away from you.

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:48.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:49.936
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

